OL,3,ABrazil's left-wing President Lula
OL,4,Aelected for fourth term, beating Flavio
OL,5,ABolsonaro in knife-edge vote
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazil's left-wing President Lula is
OL,8,Felected for a fourth term, beating
OL,9,FFlavio Bolsonaro in a knife-edge vote -
OL,10,Fwho is Lula?
OL,12,FRight-wing senator Bolsonaro - the son
OL,13,Fof imprisoned former president Jair
OL,14,FBolsonaro - won the first round earlier
OL,15,Fthis month
OL,17,FLula, 80, had said the election was a
OL,18,Fmatter of "sovereignty" and people
OL,19,Ffaced a choice between someone who
OL,20,Fkissed the Brazilian flag and someone
OL,21,Fwho kissed the American flag
